@startuml portal_lifecycle
hide empty description

state "Broker" as broker {
  [*] --> New
  New --> Starting : StartRequested
  Starting --> Running : all workers ready\npublish complete pool
  Starting --> Failed : startup failure\nrollback + reap batch
  Running --> Closing : CloseRequested
  Starting --> Closing : concurrent CloseRequested
  New --> Closing : CloseRequested
  Failed --> Closing : cleanup retry
  Closing --> Closed : cleanup complete
  Closing --> Failed : cleanup failure
}

state "Worker RPC" as worker {
  [*] --> AwaitingRequest
  AwaitingRequest --> Dispatching : request frame
  Dispatching --> SendingReply : dispatch result
  SendingReply --> AwaitingRequest : ReplySucceeded
  SendingReply --> Stopped : ReplyFailed
  AwaitingRequest --> Stopped : peer close / partial frame
  Dispatching --> Stopped : protocol violation
}

note right of Starting
  One absolute 30s deadline spans
  accept and readiness for the batch.
  No provisional worker is published.
end note

note right of SendingReply
  A failed or partial write is terminal;
  no error frame may be appended.
end note
@enduml
